---
import Slide from '../ui/Slide.astro';
---

<Slide
  id="s20-layer-workloads"
  chapter="Layers"
  title="Deployments & ReplicaSets"
  notes="Deployment owns ReplicaSets; each rollout creates a new RS. READY vs AVAILABLE differ during surge. Stuck rollouts: maxUnavailable, progressDeadline, failing readiness on new pods, or selector label typos. Commands on next slide."
>
  <div class="stagger flex flex-col gap-6">
    <section>
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-deck-cyan">Purpose</h3>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-deck-text/90 md:text-xl">
        Declarative workload management — desired replicas, rolling updates, surge/unavailable budgets, and revision history.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-deck-rose">Typical failures</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-lg text-deck-text/90 md:text-xl">
        <li>• <code class="text-deck-cyan/80">maxSurge</code> / <code class="text-deck-cyan/80">maxUnavailable</code> block progress</li>
        <li>• New pods fail readiness → rollout stalls</li>
        <li>• Label selector mismatch → RS creates zero pods</li>
        <li>• Old RS not scaled down → mixed versions serving traffic</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-deck-amber">Observable symptoms</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-lg text-deck-text/90 md:text-xl">
        <li>• Rollout status stuck or progress deadline exceeded</li>
        <li>• AVAILABLE replicas lag behind READY during surge</li>
        <li>• Multiple ReplicaSet generations with active pods</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Slide>
